@startuml bausteinsicht-ebene2
' arc42 §5.1 Bausteinsicht, Ebene 2 (Whitebox Subsystem Analysis)
' Interfaces nach arc42 §3.2; CB-Kanten exakt die sechs aus arc42 §6.4
title Bausteinsicht Ebene 2 – Whitebox Subsystem Analysis (UML-Komponentendiagramm)
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

component "React-UI\n<<Frontend>>\nVite, localhost:5173" as UI #eeeeee

package "Subsystem Analysis" {
  component "Coordinator\n<<Microservice>> :3000\nEntry Point · Read Model\nOverall · Retry-Publisher · SSE" as COORD #fff2cc
  component "Config-Service\n<<Microservice>> :3001\nCRUD Motorkonfigurationen" as CONFIG #eeeeee
  database "PostgreSQL 16\n<<OSS>> :5432" as DB #eeeeee
  component "Fluids\n<<Algorithmus-Microservice>> :3002\nAnker · Oil, Fuel, Cooling" as FLU #eeeeee
  component "Drivetrain\n<<Algorithmus-Microservice>> :3003\nPower Transmission, Gearbox" as DRV #eeeeee
  component "Mechanical\n<<Algorithmus-Microservice>> :3004\nStarting, PTO, Mounting, Exhaust" as MEC #eeeeee
  component "EMS\n<<Algorithmus-Microservice>> :3005\nFan-in Drivetrain + Mechanical\n**neu: version++ Invalidierung**" as EMS #fff2cc
  queue "Apache Kafka 3.9.1 <<OSS>>\nkafka:19092 · Consumer Group je Service\nTopics: analysis-status, analysis-result,\n**analysis-retry (neu)**" as KAFKA #d9ead3
}

' --- UI -> Subsystem ---
UI -(0- COORD : IAnalysis (start, retry)
UI -(0- COORD : IStream (SSE)
UI -(0- COORD : ISimulationProxy
UI -(0- CONFIG : IConfig (CRUD)

' --- REST-Übergänge der Choreografie, alle mit Circuit Breaker (arc42 §6.4) ---
COORD -(0- CONFIG : IConfig  **CB**
COORD -(0- FLU : IAnalyze  **CB**
FLU -(0- DRV : IAnalyze  **CB**
FLU -(0- MEC : IAnalyze  **CB**
DRV -(0- EMS : IAnalyze\nsource=drivetrain  **CB**
MEC -(0- EMS : IAnalyze\nsource=mechanical  **CB**

' --- Simulation-Controller (neu) in jedem Algorithmus-Service ---
COORD -(0- FLU : ISimulation
COORD -(0- DRV : ISimulation
COORD -(0- MEC : ISimulation
COORD -(0- EMS : ISimulation

' --- Kafka-Topics (neu) ---
COORD -(0- KAFKA : IStatusEvents, IResultEvents\nIRetryCommands (publish)
FLU -(0- KAFKA : IStatusEvents, IResultEvents\nIRetryCommands
DRV -(0- KAFKA : IStatusEvents, IResultEvents\nIRetryCommands
MEC -(0- KAFKA : IStatusEvents, IResultEvents\nIRetryCommands
EMS -(0- KAFKA : IStatusEvents (+ consume)\nIResultEvents, IRetryCommands

' --- Persistenz ---
CONFIG -(0- DB : IConfigDB (TypeORM)

legend bottom
  **Farben-Legende (Änderungen gegenüber Übung 5)**
  |<#d9ead3> grün |= neu: Kafka-Topics, analysis-retry, EMS-Versionierung, Simulation-Controller (ISimulation) |
  |<#fff2cc> gelb |= geändert: Coordinator ohne Retry-Ausführung, CB nur noch zu Config und Fluids; EMS mit Versionierung |
  |<#eeeeee> grau |= unverändert |
  **Herkunft der Technologien**
  | OSS | Apache Kafka, PostgreSQL, Opossum (Circuit Breaker), NestJS |
  | In-house | Coordinator, Config-Service, Fluids, Drivetrain, Mechanical, EMS, React-UI |
  **Notation:** —( )— benötigte (Socket) / angebotene (Lollipop) Schnittstelle · **CB** = Circuit Breaker beim Aufrufer · Kafka-Interfaces = Topics
endlegend
@enduml
